<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:53b75c8c6a6913c36575df40a8a98671aae1cf377ce9beb0ceb418a58648a33b> <https://example.org/slice/text> "5. The shell middens on the south bar are older than the landing, and\nno survey has counted them; the café on the quay sells the smaller ones\nto visitors, which is one reason the count keeps falling every season." .
